  dialogueLines:
  - 'I heard screaming coming from your house last night. '
  - And something that sounded suspiciously like... a tiny fire alarm?
  - "You do you. If you guys like this activity\u2026"
  - Well, I certainly hope you're not keeping anything dangerous in there. Or anyone.
  - "Is this some kind of a joke? Sometimes I don\u2019t understand this generation."
